# WebUni Redesign Walkthrough

I have successfully redesigned the public pages of the application to match the "WebUni" template style and implemented a split layout architecture.

## Changes Overview

### Layout Architecture
- **Public Layout**: Created a new [Header](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Header.tsx#7-62) (Top Navigation) and [Footer](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Footer.tsx#6-104) (Rich Content) for public pages (`/`, `/courses`, `/contact`, `/blog`).
- **App Layout**: Enhanced the [Sidebar](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Sidebar.tsx#12-140) to support a "Fixed" mode for application pages (`/dashboard`, `/learn`, etc.), ensuring it is always visible on desktop.
- **LayoutWrapper**: Updated logic to automatically switch between layouts based on the URL path.

### New Components
- **[Header](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Header.tsx)**: Top navigation bar with Logo, Links, and Auth/Dashboard buttons.
- **[Footer](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/Footer.tsx)**: Comprehensive footer with About, Links, Recent Posts, and Contact Info widgets.
- **[PageBanner](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/PageBanner.tsx)**: Reusable banner component for internal page titles (Courses, Contact, Blog).
- **[CourseCard](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/components/CourseCard.tsx)**: Reusable card component for displaying course information.

### Pages Implemented
- **[Home Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/page.tsx)**: Completely rewritten with Hero, Search, Categories, Featured Courses, and CTA sections.
- **[Courses Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/courses/page.tsx)**: New page with Course Search, Category Filters, and Course Grid.
- **[Contact Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/contact/page.tsx)**: New page with Map placeholder, Contact Form, and Contact Details.
- **[Blog Page](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/blog/page.tsx)**: New page with Blog Post list and Sidebar (Search, Categories, Recent Posts).

### Global Styles
- **[globals.css](file:///d:/final%20year%20project/V/frontend/app/globals.css)**: Updated with WebUni theme variables (`--primary`, fonts, etc.) and utility classes (`.site-btn`, `.spad`, `.section-title`).

- **Build**: `npm run build` passed successfully.
- **Visuals**: The pages should now match the provided screenshots.

## Dashboard & Editor Updates
- **Dashboard**: Redesigned with 3-column layout, reset statistics, and implemented dynamic calendar.
- **Code Editor**: Refactored `/editor` to use Vaathiyar Light Theme and layout.
- **Home Page**: Centered hero content for better visual alignment.
- **Navigation**: "Sign Out" now correctly redirects to Home (`/`).

